{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10/4のらじらーに\n次のシングルに収録される\nアンダーのユニットメンバーが出ます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、\n中田、参加してます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃん、蘭世、ひめたん、未央奈、中田\nの5人です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近\nこの5人での撮影が多かったのも\nそういうわけなんですね＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、どのメディアも注目してるユニットですよ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/28/5026652/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、謙虚さの欠片もないですね\nうかれてますね\n反省します"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオ内でユニット名も決めちゃおうかなって思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/28/5026652/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんと一緒に考えたいなって事になりまして\nユニット名をみなさんから募集したいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選ばれたらあなたの考えた名前を\n今後使ってく事になるので\n思いついたら\nドシドシよろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/28/5026652/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://www.nhk.or.jp/radirer/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、らじらー内で\n新曲も解禁しちゃいます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌詞がもう中田そのものな感じがして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか、\nこの5人だからこそ歌える歌詞で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...まあ聴いてください！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな大きなチャンスなかなか無いです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しい(๑¯_¯๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんに\nこのユニットが大好きになってもらえたらなって思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/28/5026652/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新制服。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\nテレ玉で放送されます\n『サガラとキヨトの乃木坂ぷぷぷ』\nの記者会見がありました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MCは\nバッドボーイズの清人さんと伊織"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、ゲストに\n埼玉県出身メンバーが出ていく予定です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織の初MC番組！おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/28/5026652/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっそく今日\n初回の収録をしてきました＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑い疲れた～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/28/5026652/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"清人さんと一緒にできるから安心できるし\n本当に楽しかったです( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい番組になりそう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、なるね` ･ω･ ´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10/10が初回になります！\nまた近くなったら告知するね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ぷぷぷをよろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/28/5026652/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\n中田自身がMCを務めてます\n生ドルは明日です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/28/5026652/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"21時から！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストさんは\n吉川友さんとGEMさんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/28/5026652/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://live.nicovideo.jp/watch/lv235545893"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、伊織もMC頑張ってたから\n中田も頑張らなきゃと思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てくださいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/28/5026652/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}